<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the “Solidarity” room.\rIt show the bond between homies and\npeople, plus the history of the\fPokéathlon. Mostly the gift shop.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Only Pokéathletes who came\nin first in five courses\fcan come in here.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the “Trust” room.\nGo on ahead.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokéathlon go WAY back.\nLike, before Wi-Fi back.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you win a course, you get a\nMedal!\fI gotta win every course!\fI got zero. But I got DREAMS.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I heard Pokéathletes with crazy\nrecords get their SHOES displayed\fin the museum!\fImagine the smell in here.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} checked\nthe course record!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a old wall paintin’.\rOne person and three homies lookin’\nup at the sky like they learnin’\fsomethin’.\fOr like they lost a balloon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a old, beat-up scroll.\r“Pokéathlon Myth\rWhen a sickness took over the whole\nisland, one human and three homies\fbeat ten obstacles to spread the word\fabout the cure.”\rThey coulda just called somebody.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a old scroll.\r“The Beginnin’ of Pokéathlon\rTo honor the bond of the\nperson and three homies that\fspread the word of the cure, people\fstarted tellin’ their story.”\r...\nThe tribute eventually turned into\ften games to compete in, just\flike the obstacles in the legend...”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">RATTATA: Ffft!\n(It’s judgin’ the paintings.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">RATTATA: Kooar!\n(It want a trophy too.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ZUBAT: Quuooh.\n(It’s lost. It’s always lost.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Pokéathlon Almanac”\rThere’s mad Pokéathletes and\nhomie Medalists in\fthe pics.\n</language>
	</row>
</body>
